{"@context":"http://schema.org/","@id":"https://fast.wistia.net/embed/iframe/w1hvb2aluo","@type":"VideoObject","duration":"PT1M19S","name":"Imported YouTube Video mv-IlE2MZGY","thumbnailUrl":"https://embed-ssl.wistia.com/deliveries/b21661295689817bcf57959ab37909a98490af99.jpg?image_crop_resized=480x854","embedUrl":"https://fast.wistia.net/embed/iframe/w1hvb2aluo","uploadDate":"2026-01-16T04:07:18.000Z","description":"a Family Lawyer Auckland video","contentUrl":"https://embed-ssl.wistia.com/deliveries/10639c4ba6a43b4d1320fc523927210f51dbf365.m3u8","transcript":"Are you looking for a family lawyer? Hi, my name is Naomi Cramer. I'm a family law specialist. I'm based in Auckland, but I serve clients all over New Zealand and overseas, especially Australia as well.

I have, over twenty five years experience. I was admitted to the bar in nineteen ninety seven and I hold a current practicing certificate as both a barrister and solicitor. Over the years I have chosen to focus my areas of family law to two very specific areas so I can really hone in my skills on those areas. Those are family violence and care of children. If you have an urgent matter, please contact me over the weekend. I'm available over the weekends to assist in obtaining urgent applications for a protection order or a parenting order where a child's safety is at risk due to violence or drugs. I've often acted for grandparents who contacted me for urgent orders, where they've had to step in and rescue their child, their moko, from a very hostile situation or one where drugs are involved.

Down below in the description there should be a link to my website that you can click on and book an online appointment or contact me. Thank you.","potentialAction":{"@type":"SeekToAction","target":"https://cramerlaw.co.nz/?wtime={seek_to_second_number}","startOffset-input":"required name=seek_to_second_number"}}

